{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "ea606176-ad08-8eba-91d8-ea42a37bc0a8",
  "created_at": "2026-01-29T13:31:43-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Stephen D. Gardiner",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Rosa Delgado",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:29:12-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Rosa Delgado. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:29:17-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, so the coyote was back this morning, right by the playground. Same one, I think, about the size of a big dog, kind of scruffy."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:29:27-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, hold on, let me back up a second. A coyote near a playground. Which playground are we talking about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:29:35-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The one behind my building. I'm at 124 Farewell Street, up in the North End. The playground's right out back there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:29:43-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "124 Farewell Street, got it. And when did you see it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:29:48-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Around eight, maybe a quarter after. It was just standing by the fence, then it walked off toward the trees. Nobody was out there yet, thank God."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:29:58-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Was it acting aggressive at all, or did it just wander through?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:30:03-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, it just wandered. It looked at me and kept going. I saw it Tuesday too, I think, after the rain had washed most of the snow off."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:30:14-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. I'm writing that down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:30:17-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, bear with me, I'm bouncing here. The baby's teething and she will not settle unless I keep moving. So if I sound like I'm walking, that's why."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:30:28-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, I can hear her. Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:30:32-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So who actually responds to this? Is it animal control, the police, somebody else? I just want to know who's supposed to deal with it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:30:41-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Animal control is the one that handles wildlife reports in the city. I can send them what you've told me. They'll log it and decide if anyone needs to go out. Coyotes are around, and they usually don't trap them, but they do want the sightings."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:30:58-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So they won't come out and grab it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:31:02-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Probably not unless it's acting sick or aggressive. If you see that, or it approaches somebody, call the police right away. Otherwise, the report helps them track where it's been."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:31:13-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, that's fine. I just wanted it on record, with the kids using that playground."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:31:19-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Can I get a callback number in case they have questions?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:31:24-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, it's 401-555-0163. Stephen Gardiner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:31:27-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Stephen Gardiner, 401-555-0163, 124 Farewell Street, coyote near the playground this morning around eight. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:31:34-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:31:36-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. I'll pass it along this afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:31:39-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, thanks. Appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:31:41-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Bye now."
    }
  ],
